    "updated_at": "2022-03-18T04:05:14Z",
    "body": "My initial thought is that we already have a way for a server to expose its timing information, and if the server chooses not to expose that information we should respect that as is the status quo.  I'm skeptical of what would motivate making CORS imply TAO.",
