    "body": "> Which attributes would you considered as \"resource-level timing\"?\r\n\r\n@noamr - from my perspective, resource-level timings include: `redirectStart`, `redirectEnd`, `requestStart`, `responseStart`, `transferSize`, `encodedBodySize` and `decodedBodySize`.",
